      "updated": 1783569570773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. boolean contains(Object)  : \n========== ============== \n\nIt comes from Collection interface , seacrhes the element \npassed as argument and return true if element present in ArrayList else return false.\n\n2.int indexOf(Object) : It  comes from List interface , its searches the element \npassed as an arguement and return its index if element present in ArrayList, otherwise return \n-1, in case of multipe elements present it return the index of 1st occurrence. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. boolean contains(Object)  : \n========== ============== \n\nIt comes from Collection interface , seacrhes the element \npassed as argument and return true if element present in ArrayList else return false.\n\n2.int indexOf(Object) : It  comes from List interface , its searches the element \npassed as an arguement and return its index if element present in ArrayList, otherwise return \n-1, in case of multipe elements present it return the index of 1st occurrence. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
