      "updated": 1783573771822,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Exercise\n==========\n\nCreate a class called Emp with following instance members:\n\nage\nname\nsal\n\nProvide appropriate constructor to initialize Emp object. Then create a driver class called UseEmp which maintains a list of employees. Now do the following operations on this list:\n\nAdd 4 Emp objects\nDisplay Emp records\nRemove an Emp object from the list\nSort the List",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Exercise\n==========\n\nCreate a class called Emp with following instance members:\n\nage\nname\nsal\n\nProvide appropriate constructor to initialize Emp object. Then create a driver class called UseEmp which maintains a list of employees. Now do the following operations on this list:\n\nAdd 4 Emp objects\nDisplay Emp records\nRemove an Emp object from the list\nSort the List",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
